# Keep line endings consistent across platforms.
#
# The theme and all scaffold files ship with LF, and the existing content is LF,
# so pin LF in the repository and in the working tree. Without this, a machine
# with `core.autocrlf=true` (the Git for Windows default, and the setting on this
# machine) rewrites every file to CRLF on checkout, which shows up as a whole-repo
# diff and churns the theme's LF-sensitive sources.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets: never line-ending converted, never diffed as text.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.avif binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.mp3 binary
*.wav binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary

# Snapshot fixtures used by the visual test suite.
*.snap binary
